WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.330
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.510
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.110
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.650
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.650
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.060
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.620
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:35.230
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.930
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.700
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.370
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.080
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.340
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.480
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.620
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.560
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.360
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.600
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:15.900
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:52.680
No..

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.090
Not again!

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.600
I don't want to!!

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:59.940
You can't make me!!

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:12.560
Who... Who the hell am I?

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.710
A 12 year-old in grade ten...!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.150
You must be a really
good student, Fei...

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.810
I'll have to be careful
you don't leave me behind!

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:44.380
l am not. I think they probably made
the entrance exam easier for me.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.190
No, you're really smart!

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.520
In America, this is
what they call "skipping."

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.160
You mean this kind of skipping?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.760
I mean "skipping a grade.”

00:02:55.840 --> 00:03:00.500
Over there, smart students are
able to advance one or two grades.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.230
Right, Fei?

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.240
You're amazing, Fei.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.610
It feels ticklish to be praised.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:13.620
In Ukiya's case, he should probably
go <i>back</i> one or two grades.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.260
Ikusawa, that's too mean.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.620
Hear, hear! No objections!

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:22.620
Okay, then are you actually studying
for the final exams that start tomorrow?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.890
<i>Of course.!</i>

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.390
Starting tonight.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:32.030
Doesn't that mean you're
just cramming overnight?

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:43.580
All right!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.550
It's time for exam rehearsal!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.350
<i>" Gcmdagcfienncmu, skimran, rankefidcmuryuu."</i>

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.990
All those who can write those words
in Chinese characters, raise your hands!

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:59.560
Here!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.120
Humph, just the usual two.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:06.200
Today is the 22nd, so I'll
pick roll number 13, lsogai!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:08.870
E- Excuse me, but that has
nothing to do with the date...

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.970
You just don't get it, do you?
It was meant to fool you.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.600
At any rate, come to
the front and write it!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.210
Y- Yes, sir.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.510
Why are we learning
Chinese characters now?

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:23.350
This Japanese
History class, isn't it?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.850
It's simple harassment!

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.190
Hey, you, over there!
Take that and that and that!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.630
Chalk, chalk, chalk, chalk!

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.630
Ouch!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.660
Take that and that and that!
Chalk, chalk, chalk, chalk!

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.570
Do you know the buddy system?!
Collective responsibility!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.270
Needless chatter is the
responsibility of the entire class!!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.410
He's really pushing it.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:52.210
Tell me about it.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.650
Have you written it, lsogai?!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.650
U- Uh, I...

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:03.660
What is that wriggling
snake poop of an answer?!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:10.500
Mr. Fukuoka, lsogai is crying.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.300
So?! And what's wrong
with making her cry?!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.270
Those who don't study
deserve a good scolding!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.110
But, sir...
(” Demo...")

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.940
" Demo"?! The Taisho
democracy is <i>recent</i> history!

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:23.810
You! Kurogane!
You can write it, yes?!

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.340
Yes.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:40.900
Is this what you wanted, sir?

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:43.730
Good. Your order of strokes
is also perfect. Excellent!

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.500
The Kamakura Shogunate in 1192
"makes a good country.”

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.100
You all would be wise to
learn kanji like Kurogane here!

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:55.950
STAFF ROOM

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.020
What did you say?! Look here!

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.020
You have a question,
you stupid fool?!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.390
You don't know it because you
weren't paying attention in my class!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.290
Jesus Christ, what
are you thinking?!

00:06:08.230 --> 00:06:10.160
Learn by Kurogane's
example over there.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.560
She received full marks
on every midterm test!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:16.730
If you only paid attention in class,
you wouldn't be asking questions!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.700
In the first place,
did you come prepared?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.170
If you came fully prepared and reviewed
later, you wouldn't be asking questions!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:27.810
<i>That is the only teacher who
truly appreciates my superiority.</i>

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.440
FINAL EXAM SCHEDULE

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.710
Math on the very first day?

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:36.680
If only l had half of
lkusawa's brain for studying...

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.280
Give up, it's impossible.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:41.490
Then I'll settle for Kuroganes
brain. She's the second-smartest.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.720
You might get stuck with
half of her gloom, too.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.490
Anything but that!

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.430
Ruriko lkusawa...

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.250
I'll be going.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:07.950
It's me.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.080
Yes, understood.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.060
Principal, come to think of it...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.690
huh??

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.070
Commander, please look at the
all-purpose electronic screen!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:30.070
This is the occurrence chart of
invader paranormal-frequencies...

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:33.440
...picked up in the vicinity of the
Far Eastern branch at 00:22 hours today.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.450
Within a one kilometer radius?

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:42.010
It was so faint, we could only
trace it to general area.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.390
Either the location of this
secret base has been discovered...

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.430
...or it's just a coincidence.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.070
Say, do you remember today's
Japanese History's class...?

00:07:56.140 --> 00:08:00.330
Yeah! A guy who would make a girl
cry is a disgrace to real men!!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.210
Mr. Fukuoka has been acting
awfully stressed recently.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:07.010
Now that you mention it, he wasn't
like that when I first transferred here.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:12.280
Pardon me! Something smelled so
good, I couldn't help myself.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:14.620
Want to grab a bite, Bancho?

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:16.820
Would you care to join us,
Princess Ruriko?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.930
Kids are supposed
to help out at home!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.260
Here, deliver this to
the Yamamotos on 3rd Street!

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.430
Oh!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.470
Ikusawa...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.470
Wow, I didn't know your folks
run a ramen restaurant, Kurogane.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:43.040
Just now, we were all talking
about stopping for a bite to eat.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.880
What's wrong with her?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.420
I don't know.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.790
Hey, Megumi! What about that delivery?!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.330
Megumi?!

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.090
Ruriko lkusawa...

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:02.730
She is the one person
I didn't want to see me!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.900
Ruriko lkusawa... Ruriko lkusawa...

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.070
CLASS COMMITTEE BALLOT Ruriko lkusawa,
19 votes. Megumi Kurogane: one vote.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:14.100
Final ballot result: Ruriko lkusawa
is the new class committee member!

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.190
<i>This time... this time
I can't lose to her!</i>

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:29.260
<i>I'll show little miss faker
what I'm capable of.</i>

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:41.900
Stop it... What gives
you the right to order me...

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.570
...to hate and to destroy?!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.000
Return to my true self?

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:49.920
What the hell are
you talking about?!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.420
You're wrong!
You're wrong!

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.260
You're wrong! You're wrong!
You're wrong!!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.560
l am me!
I am no one else!!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:13.910
Paranormal frequencies registered!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:15.270
They're here!

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.040
Look at this, sir!

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.070
This isn't funny!

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:28.950
l am Yasutaka Fukuoka! I was
born in 1946 in Fukui Prefecture!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:33.980
See?! I have pictures
from my childhood!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.460
Memories

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.290
That can't be...!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.660
Th- That's right!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:53.140
Home! I'll call my mother! I spoke
to her a few days ago. She said...

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:57.840
...she was going to send me mosquito
netting, before it gets too hot!!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.090
Mom, it's me! It's... it's me!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:18.000
<i>This number is not in service.</i>

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:31.380
<i>I can't lose. This time...</i>

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.450
I’ll <i>be number one...
...and I'll show her up!</i>

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.750
You can use this, if you like.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.750
What's wrong?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:56.440
FINAL EXAM
JAPANESE HISTORY

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:09.620
U- Um...

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.600
Hey! Did you get
the last question?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.700
Oh, you mean the questions
about the Manorial System?

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:35.080
The answers should be
true, true, false, and true.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:35.740
What?!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.610
I put true for all of them.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.670
That's just guessing.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.710
It can't be!
It can't be! It can't!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.390
Rurippe, let's get out of here
and study for tomorrow.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.090
Y- Yeah.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.030
STAFF ROOM

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:05.910
U- Um, Mr. Fukuoka... I think the
last question on the test today...

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:09.380
...had a printing error.
I got the answer wrong...

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:13.180
And I think it's unfair,
so you should disregard...

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:17.050
...the last question and give
the test only 90 possible points.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.420
Mr. Fukuoka?

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.360
Ruriko lkusawa

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.800
Megumi Kurogane

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.430
This can't be... You'll
be considerate, won't you?

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.300
I got it wrong because of a
misprint! I won't accept this!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.310
Why? Why do I have a
lower mark than hers?!

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:40.110
You'll take it into,
account, won't you?!

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:42.440
I'm different from
the other students!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:46.180
I always pay full attention
in your classes! Please!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:49.120
'Up- 'up-

00:13:49.190 --> 00:13:50.660
Mr. Fukuoka?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.160
Who am I?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:56.250
Who... am I?

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.860
- Mr. Fukuoka?
- No! You're wrong! You're wrong!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.190
No, you're right.

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.100
This is what I am.
This is what I should be!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.470
I will return to myself!

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:15.010
A- A monster!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.750
Commander! My God...

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:18.810
What's wrong?

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.750
Reaction point zero!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:21.840
What?!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.790
Directly over this base!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.570
Don't tell anyone about this!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:41.070
No... I must eliminate
those who know my secret!

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.210
N- No, I can't!
I can't do that!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.880
I... I'm...

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.510
I'm... human!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:54.880
I want to fall in love and I want
to eat good food! That's why...!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:59.550
I want to continue to think and
live for myself! I am not a puppet!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:03.230
Give up. I am a puppet.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:07.630
l am a thing to be manipulated,
to bring destruction and chaos.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.040
You're wrong!

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.200
Listen! Don't breathe a
word of this to anybody.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.240
Or I may not be able
to remain a human being!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.380
Arrow of Light!

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.280
Enemy detected.

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:27.180
Roll number 11, Ruriko lkusawa.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.890
Kurogane, over here!

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.260
Are you all right?!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.260
Why...?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.530
I came to the staff room because
you seemed upset. When I did...

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.900
Why is it always you?!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:45.630
Everything... everything is
messed up because of you!!

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:50.500
I couldn't get the test changed to 90
points, the teacher turned into a monster...

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:52.940
It's not fair! At this rate,
I'll never beat you!!

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.140
Wait! What are you talking about?!
And what do you mean about the teacher?!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.720
I AM NOT A MONSTER.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.950
Chalk?

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.690
Target acquired.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.890
<i>Mr. Fukuoka', lsogai is crying.</i>

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:18.800
<i>So?! And what's wrong with making her cry' </i>

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:19.970
<i>But, sir...</i>

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.270
She gave me back talk.
She is the enemy.

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:25.570
She is the enemy who
disrupted my class!

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.310
Class?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.900
The enemy!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.020
Kill her! Kill her!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.060
Kill her! Kill her!
Kill the worm!

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:44.030
645... The Taika Reforms...
"Kill the worm"... in the year 645!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.700
- Where is Rurippe?!
- Captain!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.160
Where is lkusawa?!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.210
We have to hurry...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.200
Commander! Can you
hear me, Commander?!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.240
We'll have to split up
and search for her!

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.720
Bancho, go down to the base
and get reinforcements!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.980
I'll help look
for Princess Ruriko!

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.110
Establishing contact comes first!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:12.320
U- Understood! Captain's
orders are absolute!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.350
Good! Let's go, everyone!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.590
Roger, AEGIS!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.060
SCIENCE ROOM

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:24.560
Don't bother hiding.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.720
<i>It's all right. Let her die.</i>

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:48.590
<i>Yes. As long as she's eliminated!</i>

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.400
<i>She saw me making deliveries...</i>

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.700
<i>I'm sure she laughed at me!</i>

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.600
<i>At me. At pathetic me.</i>

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.970
<i>She's richer than me...</i>

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:03.100
<i>...more popular than me,
smarter than me...</i>

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.670
<i>...so it would be
better without her!</i>

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.540
Commencing elimination.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:12.380
Rate of accuracy 99.9%.

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:17.450
<i>Now I'll be the number
one student in the school...</i>

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.360
<i>But...</i>

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.790
Fire!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.630
Exterminate!!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.140
W- What is this?!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.170
No, it's wrong...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.140
...Mr. Fukuoka.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.650
Kurogane, you...!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.870
Don't tell me, that's a...

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.810
Please don't kill her.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.410
Ridiculous!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:52.150
High energy reading confirmed.

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:55.750
Far surpassing human limitations.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.160
This is only the first
day of final exams.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.930
My battle with lkusawa
has just started!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:04.830
Stay back! Stay back, Kurogane!

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:09.540
Kill her. Eliminate
dangerous elements.

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:14.130
Kurogane! Run away quickly!! Run!!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:16.370
Run!!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.020
Eliminate her.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:29.390
That's definitely gate power!
A tough wall no one can get past!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.520
Yes, the Gate of Protection!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:39.140
Rurippe!
Captain Ukiya!

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:42.270
New target acquired.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.470
Vacuous Missile!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:52.780
Odds of target elimination 0.21%.

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:55.510
Commencing escape immediately.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.690
GATE OPEN!

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.290
Explosive Panda Fire Ball!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.560
You won't get away now!

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.190
Prepare yourself!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.640
You're trapped like
a rat in a trap!

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.800
How dare you wreak havoc
at our school!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.540
Wait!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.480
That's our history
teacher, Mr. Fukuoka!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.280
What?!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:27.250
You're kidding! But he's an invader
out to disturb world peace!!!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.210
I'm telling you the truth!!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.530
Odds of target
elimination increasing.

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:42.060
Ultra Cyclone Chop!!!

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:57.170
See?! He's an invader,
just like I said!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:20:59.850
Ukiya!

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.440
How are things?

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.620
We just defeated him, sir!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.590
<i>No...</i>

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:12.600
<i>I don'! want to die...</i>

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:16.100
<i>“without even knowing who I am!</i>

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:20.930
That voice...

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.970
Mr. Fukuoka!

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.010
What the hell did I just defeat!??

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.910
Commander, please tell me!!

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.890
The invaders...

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:41.360
The invaders are everywhere.

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:45.520
And they are right next to us.

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:11.020
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:14.890
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:19.860
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:23.240
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.370
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:30.540
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:33.880
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.510
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.220 --> 00:22:43.380
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:48.020
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:54.800
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
